OL,3,GNEWSAIrene stunned by haul of 107th
OL,4,Abirthday cards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 107-year-old Women's Auxiliary Air
OL,7,FForce veteran has been inundated with
OL,8,Fbirthday cards after her care home
OL,9,Fappealed for people to send 107 of them
OL,10,Fto mark her milestone.
OL,12,FIrene Gibson spent Friday with her
OL,13,Ffamily and friends having a birthday
OL,14,Fparty at Abbeyfield Castle Farm in
OL,15,FGosforth, Newcastle.
OL,17,FActivities coordinator Helen Angel said
OL,18,FIrene, who particularly loves Tai Chi
OL,19,Fclasses, was "stunned" by the 172 cards
OL,20,Fshe had to get through.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
