OL,3,GNEWSAIrene stunned by haul of 107th
OL,4,Abirthday cards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe birthday girl, who was born on 4
OL,7,FSeptember 1919 and served at Marston
OL,8,FMoor in Yorkshire during the Second
OL,9,FWorld War, said the secret to reaching
OL,10,F107-year-old was to "just carry on
OL,11,Fdoing the right thing".
